From 53ed88c4faba910e419358dce440bc9a4720a15f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FontMod <fontmod@localhost>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 16:18:43 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] sepolicy: label FontMod files as font data

Label the custom font directory with the existing font data type.
Cover both the directory and an imported font in the file contexts test
data so plat_file_contexts_data_test validates the new rule.

Custom font writes remain restricted to UPDATE_FONTS and the owner user.
The signed font updater and its fs-verity validation remain unchanged.

Base: 99c58a7cc9a44fe33c93808452d018e756d84753
---
 contexts/file_contexts_test_data | 2 ++
 private/file_contexts            | 1 +
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/contexts/file_contexts_test_data b/contexts/file_contexts_test_data
index 999976f..54343f4 100644
--- a/contexts/file_contexts_test_data
+++ b/contexts/file_contexts_test_data
@@ -964,6 +964,8 @@
 /data/rollback/999/test/test.apex                                 staging_data_file
 /data/fonts/files                                                 font_data_file
 /data/fonts/files/test                                            font_data_file
+/data/fonts/fontmod                                               font_data_file
+/data/fonts/fontmod/test.font                                     font_data_file
 /data/misc_ce                                                     system_userdir_file
 /data/misc_de                                                     system_userdir_file
 /data/system_ce                                                   system_userdir_file
diff --git a/private/file_contexts b/private/file_contexts
index 56977a1..cbbd103 100644
--- a/private/file_contexts
+++ b/private/file_contexts
@@ -664,6 +664,7 @@
 /data/rollback/\d+/[^/]+/.*\.apk  u:object_r:apk_data_file:s0
 /data/rollback/\d+/[^/]+/.*\.apex u:object_r:staging_data_file:s0
 /data/fonts/files(/.*)?     u:object_r:font_data_file:s0
+/data/fonts/fontmod(/.*)?   u:object_r:font_data_file:s0
 /data/misc_ce             u:object_r:system_userdir_file:s0
 /data/misc_de             u:object_r:system_userdir_file:s0
 /data/system_ce           u:object_r:system_userdir_file:s0
-- 
2.56.0

